# Headless tour of core_widgets (cargo xtask sim-smoke): the labels scroll, the logo rotates;
# tapping the checkable button checks it (red, the secondary color); F12 switches to the dark
# theme. Inputs due at a frame apply before it is drawn and shots after, so each shot waits a
# frame.
wait 500
shot initial
tap 385 98
wait 300
shot core_widgets_after_tap
wait 32
hotkey F12
wait 300
shot dark
